Z||000000||JohnnyK||12-30-2000||01:25 PM||||Sitting at a red light, and we get the left signal, and the guy in front of me has his head down in his passengers lap (???).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Hit the horn, and I get this clicking from the passenger side of my car. I assume it is coming from that "convenience center" but what specifically? THanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||LarryB||12-30-2000||03:06 PM||||That clicking you're hearing is probably from the horn relay, that would be a good sign. I've found that the horns tend to stick if you don't toot them every several weeks. They're in a kind of exposed position and probably get damp if you drive in the rain.<P>If you look way under the nose on each side almost directly ahead of the front you'll see the horns, they have a nut in the middle that you can try adjusting a bit with a wrench to see if you can free them up.  <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>Sitting at a red light, and we get the left signal, and the guy in front of me has his head down in his passengers lap (???).   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Hit the horn, and I get this clicking from the passenger side of my car. I assume it is coming from that "convenience center" but what specifically? THanks</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||JohnnyK||12-30-2000||03:48 PM||||Pretty sure it's coming from inside though. Is that possible?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Alex2004||12-30-2000||05:23 PM||||There is a horn relay under the passenger side dash. Mine clicked too, I replaced the relay, and I also put took some horns off a GT and then it worked. But i had clicking inside, and the horn kinda made a clicking sound as well. Hope that help any.<BR>Alex...<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:Alex917@excite.com">Alex917@excite.com</A> ||||reg||3
Z||000004||FieroJoe||12-31-2000||05:54 PM||||check for dirty connections, for the longest time my low note (driver's side) never worked, and when I got the car jacked up I just took off the wire and cleaned up the connection with steel wool, then cleaned the ground.||||reg||1
